<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Customer Satisfaction Survey</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #181b25; background-color: #f4f6f9; margin: 0; padding: 24px; }
        .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #d8dde6; overflow: hidden; }
        .header { background: #0176d3; padding: 24px; color: #ffffff; }
        .header h1 { margin: 0; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; }
        .content { padding: 24px; }
        .content p { font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5; color: #3e3e3c; }
        .case-card { background: #f3f3f3; border-left: 4px solid #0176d3; padding: 12px 16px; margin: 16px 0; border-radius: 4px; }
        .ratings { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin: 24px 0; }
        .rating-btn { display: inline-block; padding: 10px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 4px; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14px; text-align: center; }
        .star-5 { background: #2e844a; color: #ffffff; }
        .star-4 { background: #4bca81; color: #ffffff; }
        .star-3 { background: #fe9339; color: #ffffff; }
        .star-2 { background: #ea001e; color: #ffffff; }
        .star-1 { background: #ba0517; color: #ffffff; }
        .footer { padding: 16px 24px; background: #fafaf9; font-size: 12px; color: #706e6b; text-align: center; border-top: 1px solid #e5e5e5; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <h1>TechNova Cloud Customer Support</h1>
        </div>
        <div class="content">
            <p>Dear {!Contact.Name},</p>
            <p>Your support inquiry has been resolved. We strive to provide enterprise-grade service and would love your feedback on our support performance.</p>
            <div class="case-card">
                <strong>Case Number:</strong> {!Case.CaseNumber}<br/>
                <strong>Subject:</strong> {!Case.Subject}<br/>
                <strong>Status:</strong> Closed
            </div>
            <p><strong>How satisfied are you with the resolution of your issue?</strong></p>
            <table width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="4">
                <tr>
                    <td align="center"><a class="rating-btn star-5" href="#">5 - Excellent</a></td>
                    <td align="center"><a class="rating-btn star-4" href="#">4 - Good</a></td>
                    <td align="center"><a class="rating-btn star-3" href="#">3 - Average</a></td>
                    <td align="center"><a class="rating-btn star-2" href="#">2 - Poor</a></td>
                    <td align="center"><a class="rating-btn star-1" href="#">1 - Very Poor</a></td>
                </tr>
            </table>
            <p style="margin-top: 24px;">Thank you for partnering with TechNova Cloud.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="footer">
            TechNova Cloud Services &bull; Enterprise SLA & Customer Success
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
